<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8619] Remote node could not start in ssh connection</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8619</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Now there is a problem with launch remote node via ssh. Initially was an assumption that it&apos;s due to remote process has not enough time to write information into log:&#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8085&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;IGNITE-8085&lt;/a&gt;. But this correction didn&apos;t fix &lt;a href=&quot;https://ci.ignite.apache.org/project.html?projectId=IgniteTests24Java8&amp;amp;testNameId=6814497542781613621&amp;amp;tab=testDetails&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;TeamCity &lt;/a&gt; (IgniteProjectionStartStopRestartSelfTest.testStartFiveNodesInTwoCalls). &lt;br/&gt;
So  it&apos;s necessary to make launch remote node via ssh always succesful.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
